       NoDelete, Disabled, NoChangeByUser, MustChangePassword), stored as the
       Int32 the generated UserConfigurationMask enumeration uses. It backs the
       UserManagement object's Users property; it lives on UserType rather than
       in a table of its own because the mask is per-account state that the
       account's own row is the natural home for, and because that lets the
       configuration database's schema-upgrade path add it to existing
